==English==
===Etymology===
From {{OE.}} ''[[hæþen]]''.

===Pronunciation===
*:Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-iːðən|-iːðən]]

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# not adhering to an [[w:Abrahamic religion|Abrahamic religion]], [[pagan]], adhering to polytheistic beliefs, especially when uncultured or uncivilized. (derogatory)
# {{by extension}} uncultured, uncivilized, savage.
# pertaining to Germanic currents of [[neo-paganism]] known as [[Heathenry]].

